{"id":"n62385-1-14","stage":1,"title":"의미 · 意义","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62385-1-14-1","ko":"영어로 쓰여 있는데 이건 무슨 의미야?","zh":"上面是用英文写的，这是什么意思啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"영어로","meaning":"英语","explanation":"영어：英语；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"영어","audio":"/audio/9a37f8fdb58ccaa0bb5f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28241","senseId":"1","lemma":"영어","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"영어로","audio":"/audio/acf59c2f9c2d10efa30e.mp3"}},{"text":"쓰여","meaning":"被用，被使用","explanation":"쓰이다：被用，被使用；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"쓰이다","audio":"/audio/9363ab689aedbd77ccf4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16700","senseId":"1","lemma":"쓰이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"쓰여","audio":"/audio/9235acb84de63e0647ef.mp3"}},{"text":"있는데","meaning":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","explanation":"있다：某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"3","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있는데","audio":"/audio/cef0332a5e3d72106522.mp3"}},{"text":"이건","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이거：这个；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"이거","audio":"/audio/4515223b0fb4ed4e27bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71128","senseId":"1","lemma":"이거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이건","audio":"/audio/5a674df42cc1d8ac9ff2.mp3"}},{"text":"무슨","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무슨：什么","readings":[{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66237","senseId":"1","lemma":"무슨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}},{"text":"의미야?","meaning":"意义","explanation":"의미：意义；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"의미","audio":"/audio/adfc8cc897bfb433c0d9.mp3"